many  silver and black fans were waiting for  the full schedule release raider tight  end darren waller busy raising awareness  and money for addiction treatment and  recovery for youth at risk john treach  caught up with a star at his annual  fundraiser  it is a banner day for hope and healing  in las vegas the second annual concert  to shine on featuring darren waller and  his foundation and i'm joined right now  by the raiders all pro tight end and  when you set out on this sober life  and wanted to make a difference did you  ever think you'd make this kind of  impact not even close  you know i was just trying to  present myself in a way that you know  somebody could maybe look to me and  learn something from my life but i never  thought it'd be on this grand of a scale  you know i thought just maybe like a  person to person thing i never thought i  would be have this level of platform to  be honest and you really were at a rock  bottom at one point it was only five  years ago and here you are living your  best life 16 touchdowns later  what message do you have for young  people  i would say one of my favorite quotes is  winston churchill  success is moving from failure to  failure without loss of enthusiasm  so it's like your journey doesn't have  to look perfect  no i've been arrested three times i've  been suspended at every level of  athletics i've ever played on  but somehow i'm still here you know  because i've decided to make a decision  to just you know do do right by myself  first and once i can do right by me i  can do right by other people as well and  just be a vessel of love and  good things will happen and the most  rewarding aspect of this entire journey  is what  seeing somebody's life be transformed  i mean it's cool to get up here and  perform some of my music and have a  bunch of family and stuff here but it's  really at the end of the day about  somebody's life being transformed you  know being a state of hopelessness like  i was just like not knowing  if there's going to be any more good or  any more reason to have hope but you  know to give that to somebody else  that's the biggest part  that's hope and someone who's looking  forward to the chargers in week one john  treach live local now

